WEBVTT

00:03:30.283 --> 00:03:35.196
(Music)

00:03:36.796 --> 00:03:43.451
(Music)

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:46.516
Let's be honest,

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:48.715
we all have peaks
and valleys in our careers,

00:03:48.739 --> 00:03:51.280
times when we hit our stride
and do our best work,

00:03:51.304 --> 00:03:53.653
and times when we're in a slump.

00:03:53.677 --> 00:03:55.568
Most of us are worried that as we age,

00:03:55.592 --> 00:03:57.833
our physical and mental
skills will decline

00:03:57.857 --> 00:04:00.439
and we might enter into a permanent slump.